    {
      "id": "claim_48f0d1b84b5c4d54812d8a01c41e757a",
      "statement": "Scope for cross-reference resolution is determined by active conditional fences (:::python or :::js), persisting across lines until a new fence is encountered; code fence state takes precedence over scope changes to prevent transformations inside code blocks.",
